// std.heap: allocators. `General` and `Arena` are built into the compiler:
//
//     General.init() General               libc malloc/free; debug mode
//                                          reports leaks, double frees and
//                                          writes after free
//     Arena.init(backing: Allocator) Arena
//     x.allocator() Allocator              (x must be a `var`)
//     x.deinit()
//     arena.reset()                        frees all but the first block and
//                                          reuses it; earlier allocations
//                                          are invalid
